(4245972, 613018, 19831, '<td valign="top">OMG is that hiLARious!!! This is one, I had to stop and get my wife and make her look! The lighting seems just a wee bit flat, and I wish the tip were just a tad sharper. Awesome idea though, and big bonus points for the humor! Oh, and the sac of clementine oranges are a great touch, they really make the shot! Oy vey! :-) Great job!</td>', 'OMG is that hiLARious!!! This is one, I had to stop and get my wife and make her look! The lighting seems just a wee bit flat, and I wish the tip were just a tad sharper. Awesome idea though, and big bonus points for the humor! Oh, and the sac of clementine oranges are a great touch, they really make the shot! Oy vey! :-) Great job!', '2007-11-14 07:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
