(4247406, 610781, 45631, '<td valign="top">A good take on this challenge.  Focus seems a bit soft on my computer.  Maybe would have framed it without the bush to the left as it draws the eye a bit, probably would have gone from the thing (?) on the ground as this would have put the windmill on the first third line which would improve the composition.  Well done.</td>', 'A good take on this challenge.  Focus seems a bit soft on my computer.  Maybe would have framed it without the bush to the left as it draws the eye a bit, probably would have gone from the thing (?) on the ground as this would have put the windmill on the first third line which would improve the composition.  Well done.', '2007-11-14 16:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
