(4247421, 613073, 45631, '<td valign="top">A great capture for this challenge.  The framing works well for this picture but the truck could be a bit sharper to draw you eye to it more as the focal point.</td>', 'A great capture for this challenge.  The framing works well for this picture but the truck could be a bit sharper to draw you eye to it more as the focal point.', '2007-11-14 16:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4247425, 612948, 45631, '<td valign="top">Took me a bit to work out what you''d done here (bit thick some times).  A clever take on this challenge for something different.</td>', 'Took me a bit to work out what you''d done here (bit thick some times).  A clever take on this challenge for something different.', '2007-11-14 16:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4247428, 612446, 45631, '<td valign="top">Without the title I would not have seen this shot a topless.  It''s an interesting take on the challenge.  I like the composition of the image but it seems rather dark on my monitor.</td>', 'Without the title I would not have seen this shot a topless.  It''s an interesting take on the challenge.  I like the composition of the image but it seems rather dark on my monitor.', '2007-11-14 16:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4247446, 613079, 48588, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit dark / muted for my tastes.</td>', 'Looks a bit dark / muted for my tastes.', '2007-11-14 16:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4247448, 612446, 48588, '<td valign="top">Oh, brighter would''ve been better!  Nice concept.</td>', 'Oh, brighter would''ve been better!  Nice concept.', '2007-11-14 16:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4247489, 612653, 86302, '<td valign="top">I love the idea but the colors aren''t quite right.  You could probably get a little better POV as well</td>', 'I love the idea but the colors aren''t quite right.  You could probably get a little better POV as well', '2007-11-14 16:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4247511, 613046, 85394, '<td valign="top">Neat idea-and I like the detail and the layout of the orange halves.  A few critiques-since everything is in focus, it''s a little dull.  Also-to me it appears underexposed (but different monitors do have different settings).  Also-isn''t it strange, the two halves clearly don''t go together.  Also the dark background makes it appear to float, and the underexposure leaves little room for actually seeing the shadows, which make it appear kind of flat.<br/> <br/>If it suits, try a lighter background (unless there''s a reason you chose this dark one?) and try a larger f-stop (smaller number).</td>', 'Neat idea-and I like the detail and the layout of the orange halves.  A few critiques-since everything is in focus, it''s a little dull.  Also-to me it appears underexposed (but different monitors do have different settings).  Also-isn''t it strange, the two halves clearly don''t go together.  Also the dark background makes it appear to float, and the underexposure leaves little room for actually seeing the shadows, which make it appear kind of flat. If it suits, try a lighter background (unless there''s a reason you chose this dark one?) and try a larger f-stop (smaller number).', '2007-11-14 16:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4247515, 611663, 85394, '<td valign="top">Cool!  This actually makes me feel like I''m moving and trips my eyes out.  An easy way to do some good panning!  I love the wide camera angle as well.  It''s very effective.  Cool colors.</td>', 'Cool!  This actually makes me feel like I''m moving and trips my eyes out.  An easy way to do some good panning!  I love the wide camera angle as well.  It''s very effective.  Cool colors.', '2007-11-14 16:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4247516, 611034, 85394, '<td valign="top">Cute idea, but did you use the flash?  It''s a little bright...and therefore flat.</td>', 'Cute idea, but did you use the flash?  It''s a little bright...and therefore flat.', '2007-11-14 16:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4247518, 613044, 85394, '<td valign="top">Cool!  How in the world did you get this?  Were you at the zoo?  I''ve never seen a penguin like this.  Neat depth of field.  I like the guy behind him just chillin'' in the snow.</td>', 'Cool!  How in the world did you get this?  Were you at the zoo?  I''ve never seen a penguin like this.  Neat depth of field.  I like the guy behind him just chillin'' in the snow.', '2007-11-14 16:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4247522, 612955, 85394, '<td valign="top">Chochkys!  (sp?)  I like your method of display, and the other ones in back.  I also love the backdrop choices.  That reflective table is beautiful.  My only complaint-you split the scene in half.  Use rule-of-thirds.  If it was my choice, I would have ditched some of the gray background on the top half, and shown more of that beautiful reflective table.</td>', 'Chochkys!  (sp?)  I like your method of display, and the other ones in back.  I also love the backdrop choices.  That reflective table is beautiful.  My only complaint-you split the scene in half.  Use rule-of-thirds.  If it was my choice, I would have ditched some of the gray background on the top half, and shown more of that beautiful reflective table.', '2007-11-14 16:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4247540, 612342, 52992, '<td valign="top">Nice colours and contrast.</td>', 'Nice colours and contrast.', '2007-11-14 16:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4247548, 612903, 85394, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea-a little cliche with the wine and rose (like something you''d buy in a poster shop).  I do like the layout with the vertical bottle and diagonal rose stem.  I''m not sure about A) the flash/bright light used-it''s over exposed and B) the angle at which you shot.  Is there a purpose to to it?  It would have been more effective to shoot down at the same level as the subjects-instead the image appears flattened and smaller.  The excessive flash also eliminated any possibility of a shadow, so the image appears very 1 dimentional.</td>', 'Interesting idea-a little cliche with the wine and rose (like something you''d buy in a poster shop).  I do like the layout with the vertical bottle and diagonal rose stem.  I''m not sure about A) the flash/bright light used-it''s over exposed and B) the angle at which you shot.  Is there a purpose to to it?  It would have been more effective to shoot down at the same level as the subjects-instead the image appears flattened and smaller.  The excessive flash also eliminated any possibility of a shadow, so the image appears very 1 dimentional.', '2007-11-14 16:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4247553, 612886, 52992, '<td valign="top">This is flawless.  Great exposure, beautiful lighting, even background.  DOF is spot on too.<br/> <br/>THIS is what I want to learn how to do.</td>', 'This is flawless.  Great exposure, beautiful lighting, even background.  DOF is spot on too. THIS is what I want to learn how to do.', '2007-11-14 17:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4247583, 613018, 78821, '<td valign="top">very unique. very disturbing, but most of all very fitting and hilarious. the white balance seems a bit off though, and the background''s bit distracting, and wish you''d used a wider dof so more of the image is in focus. 7 from me.</td>', 'very unique. very disturbing, but most of all very fitting and hilarious. the white balance seems a bit off though, and the background''s bit distracting, and wish you''d used a wider dof so more of the image is in focus. 7 from me.', '2007-11-14 17:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4247592, 613073, 85394, '<td valign="top">I like the colors, the wide angle, and the perspective.  Way to think outside the "van"  :)</td>', 'I like the colors, the wide angle, and the perspective.  Way to think outside the "van"  :)', '2007-11-14 17:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4247599, 610498, 85394, '<td valign="top">I like this image, especially the colors.  What I don''t like is the near perfect centering and symmetry.  The only things that make it interesting (besides the color) are the clouds on the left, and the shadows.  Again, this splits the image neatly in half.  What if you had shifted the lighthouse to the right side of the image?  I do like the nearly "straight up" perspective.</td>', 'I like this image, especially the colors.  What I don''t like is the near perfect centering and symmetry.  The only things that make it interesting (besides the color) are the clouds on the left, and the shadows.  Again, this splits the image neatly in half.  What if you had shifted the lighthouse to the right side of the image?  I do like the nearly "straight up" perspective.', '2007-11-14 17:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4247607, 612830, 78821, '<td valign="top">I like the concept. But you did way too much post processing in my opinion. you can see banding in the skys, too much levels/curves? and the haloing of the tree is distracting. The color in the end is pretty, but you gotta find a balance so that it looks natural and not harsh. All that said, I like the picture and I gave it a 7.</td>', 'I like the concept. But you did way too much post processing in my opinion. you can see banding in the skys, too much levels/curves? and the haloing of the tree is distracting. The color in the end is pretty, but you gotta find a balance so that it looks natural and not harsh. All that said, I like the picture and I gave it a 7.', '2007-11-14 17:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4247620, 613088, 46832, '<td valign="top">What is topless here?  Looks like it would have been better in Duotones.</td>', 'What is topless here?  Looks like it would have been better in Duotones.', '2007-11-14 17:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
