(4248336, 610781, 49643, '<td valign="top">Nice subject matching to the contest. Composition can be better by placing the subject in rule of third in landscape or taking the portrait image of the subject.</td>', 'Nice subject matching to the contest. Composition can be better by placing the subject in rule of third in landscape or taking the portrait image of the subject.', '2007-11-14 23:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
