(4248341, 612559, 49643, '<td valign="top">Nice subject &amp; composition but need to be more bright as well as your main subject is not in full focus.</td>', 'Nice subject & composition but need to be more bright as well as your main subject is not in full focus.', '2007-11-14 23:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4248361, 611446, 80264, '<td valign="top">Too funny! I like it. :)</td>', 'Too funny! I like it. :)', '2007-11-15 00:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4248519, 613065, 76430, '<td valign="top">Either you uploaded the wrong picture or you''ve got a much better imagination than I do.  I took pictures of elephants and gazelles last Thursday and they didn''t look anything like this.  I don''t see anything topless other than cropped lamp and twigs arrangement.  It has good lighting and focus, but not much else of interest to me.</td>', 'Either you uploaded the wrong picture or you''ve got a much better imagination than I do.  I took pictures of elephants and gazelles last Thursday and they didn''t look anything like this.  I don''t see anything topless other than cropped lamp and twigs arrangement.  It has good lighting and focus, but not much else of interest to me.', '2007-11-15 01:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4248522, 612797, 77192, '<td valign="top">forgive me for being extremely pedantic here, but nothing''s really topless here...just in bits.<br/> <br/>ETA: Well, thinking about it, the legs are, I suppose. I''ve changed my vote. Many apologies</td>', 'forgive me for being extremely pedantic here, but nothing''s really topless here...just in bits. ETA: Well, thinking about it, the legs are, I suppose. I''ve changed my vote. Many apologies', '2007-11-15 01:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4248576, 613046, 48997, '<td valign="top">Haha! Made me think for a second.</td>', 'Haha! Made me think for a second.', '2007-11-15 03:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4248583, 613063, 48997, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I''d like it better if there were a third apple, the glare reminds me of eyes and I struggle to see the picture. I love the angle of the cut, though, the line down the second apple, the faint shadows round the bases and behind the first stem. Good job!</td>', 'Very nice. I''d like it better if there were a third apple, the glare reminds me of eyes and I struggle to see the picture. I love the angle of the cut, though, the line down the second apple, the faint shadows round the bases and behind the first stem. Good job!', '2007-11-15 03:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4248587, 612622, 48997, '<td valign="top">Very intriguing. It would appeal to me more if there were a wider range of shades -- from white all the way to black. But it has good composition. Rule of thirds is working well for you... Nice job.</td>', 'Very intriguing. It would appeal to me more if there were a wider range of shades -- from white all the way to black. But it has good composition. Rule of thirds is working well for you... Nice job.', '2007-11-15 03:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4248588, 613033, 48997, '<td valign="top">Great texture, great color range, a little bland on the composition. Nice job, though.</td>', 'Great texture, great color range, a little bland on the composition. Nice job, though.', '2007-11-15 03:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4248590, 610591, 59719, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of the Munsters!!! 6</td>', 'This reminds me of the Munsters!!! 6', '2007-11-15 03:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4248591, 612830, 48997, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, and the green "rows" create a nice effect. The branch "touching" the edge of the photo, however, distracts me. I''m constantly wondering where it leads...</td>', 'Nice colors, and the green "rows" create a nice effect. The branch "touching" the edge of the photo, however, distracts me. I''m constantly wondering where it leads...', '2007-11-15 03:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4248593, 612944, 48997, '<td valign="top">Nice focus, and the condensation is a great effect. The tree branch "touching" the lip of the bottle, however, strangely resembles a straw, and leads the eye away from the subject...</td>', 'Nice focus, and the condensation is a great effect. The tree branch "touching" the lip of the bottle, however, strangely resembles a straw, and leads the eye away from the subject...', '2007-11-15 03:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4248597, 612573, 48997, '<td valign="top">Very colorful! It''s not obvious at first glance that that is a bathing suit top, which leaves for a moment of finger-chewing. Maybe try cropping in tighter, too, the eye has so much room to ... wander ... Other than that, not a bad image! Keep it up!</td>', 'Very colorful! It''s not obvious at first glance that that is a bathing suit top, which leaves for a moment of finger-chewing. Maybe try cropping in tighter, too, the eye has so much room to ... wander ... Other than that, not a bad image! Keep it up!', '2007-11-15 03:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4248598, 612446, 48997, '<td valign="top">Very dark...</td>', 'Very dark...', '2007-11-15 03:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4248600, 611438, 48997, '<td valign="top">The "top-heavy" effect created by the leaves is great!</td>', 'The "top-heavy" effect created by the leaves is great!', '2007-11-15 03:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4248601, 612815, 48997, '<td valign="top">Creative!</td>', 'Creative!', '2007-11-15 03:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4248606, 612392, 48997, '<td valign="top">Not bad! I wish the part of the bottle closest to me was in focus -- that''s really what matters. Either that or you had shifted the angle so the opening of the bottle was closest to the lens, and still kept it in focus. Other than that it''s a nice image! Keep it up!</td>', 'Not bad! I wish the part of the bottle closest to me was in focus -- that''s really what matters. Either that or you had shifted the angle so the opening of the bottle was closest to the lens, and still kept it in focus. Other than that it''s a nice image! Keep it up!', '2007-11-15 03:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4248608, 610996, 48997, '<td valign="top">Great focus, colors, composition! I like!!</td>', 'Great focus, colors, composition! I like!!', '2007-11-15 03:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4248610, 613015, 48997, '<td valign="top">Great one!</td>', 'Great one!', '2007-11-15 03:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4248611, 613049, 48997, '<td valign="top">Love the focus, subject, border, background! A bit small, but oh well...</td>', 'Love the focus, subject, border, background! A bit small, but oh well...', '2007-11-15 03:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4248614, 612455, 48997, '<td valign="top">Love the composition, the colors, the style! Great job!</td>', 'Love the composition, the colors, the style! Great job!', '2007-11-15 03:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4248615, 610439, 48997, '<td valign="top">Reflections a bit distracting...</td>', 'Reflections a bit distracting...', '2007-11-15 03:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4248656, 612490, 6999, '<td valign="top">Almost reminds me of Martin Parr; he has a photo of a proper cup of tea served in an English tea room, which works along similar lines: saturated colour, direct flash to remove all shadows, simple centred framing - lacking in pretension, just showing us the object as found, as seen. Arguably just documenting the item, letting us draw our own conclusions. He would work more simply still however - total depth of field, rather than using the focus to point the eye in this manner. People will call it a pointless snapshot, perhaps; and perhaps they''re right - perhaps its the kind of thing that needs rather to be seen in a series, than as a stand alone image.</td>', 'Almost reminds me of Martin Parr; he has a photo of a proper cup of tea served in an English tea room, which works along similar lines: saturated colour, direct flash to remove all shadows, simple centred framing - lacking in pretension, just showing us the object as found, as seen. Arguably just documenting the item, letting us draw our own conclusions. He would work more simply still however - total depth of field, rather than using the focus to point the eye in this manner. People will call it a pointless snapshot, perhaps; and perhaps they''re right - perhaps its the kind of thing that needs rather to be seen in a series, than as a stand alone image.', '2007-11-15 05:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4248658, 612340, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nicely organised, and well shot technically. Somewhat obvious and lacking a real spark other than as a pleasant series of colours for me, however.</td>', 'Nicely organised, and well shot technically. Somewhat obvious and lacking a real spark other than as a pleasant series of colours for me, however.', '2007-11-15 05:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4248661, 613093, 6999, '<td valign="top">Beer as not-beer, perhaps; without title I''m not sure I could have told you what this was - and I think I might have liked it more for not knowing, for the indecipherable nature of it. It reminds me of the foam one sometimes finds on plants in the morning, the eggs of insects.</td>', 'Beer as not-beer, perhaps; without title I''m not sure I could have told you what this was - and I think I might have liked it more for not knowing, for the indecipherable nature of it. It reminds me of the foam one sometimes finds on plants in the morning, the eggs of insects.', '2007-11-15 05:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4248664, 612817, 6999, '<td valign="top">There is, I think, a delicacy required in the framing of a such a very simple image: exactly how far one chooses to allow negative space around the object. The immediate impression here is that you''ve cropped or framed it too closely and that, for a really basic illustration of something, as this shot is, you should give it more room to breathe. After all, in itself, it''s really not an interesting object.</td>', 'There is, I think, a delicacy required in the framing of a such a very simple image: exactly how far one chooses to allow negative space around the object. The immediate impression here is that you''ve cropped or framed it too closely and that, for a really basic illustration of something, as this shot is, you should give it more room to breathe. After all, in itself, it''s really not an interesting object.', '2007-11-15 05:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4248667, 612727, 6999, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity - the extremity of the simplicity. It could have been taken further, with more control of the light to make a smoother background (not without keeping some element of graduation across those areas of light and (for want of a better word) shade. For a set-up, it shows at least a spark of inspiration.</td>', 'I like the simplicity - the extremity of the simplicity. It could have been taken further, with more control of the light to make a smoother background (not without keeping some element of graduation across those areas of light and (for want of a better word) shade. For a set-up, it shows at least a spark of inspiration.', '2007-11-15 05:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4248670, 612937, 6999, '<td valign="top">Whoa, Les Dawson lives! I get, from your title as much as anything - certainly not from the image itself - a sense of disrespect that I don''t like much. A sense of her being laughed at for her age, her look.</td>', 'Whoa, Les Dawson lives! I get, from your title as much as anything - certainly not from the image itself - a sense of disrespect that I don''t like much. A sense of her being laughed at for her age, her look.', '2007-11-15 05:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4248672, 612535, 6999, '<td valign="top">Almost an interesting study of the moulding, the casting of this object. Dynamically, in light, it becomes a touch flat: perhpas the background is simply to ordinary grey. The illumination of the cureves of the tap are intriguing though.</td>', 'Almost an interesting study of the moulding, the casting of this object. Dynamically, in light, it becomes a touch flat: perhpas the background is simply to ordinary grey. The illumination of the cureves of the tap are intriguing though.', '2007-11-15 05:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4248675, 612677, 45631, '<td valign="top">Great, a tree that is truly topless instead of one that has just been chopped off in the shot.  Don''t know that I like the center composition and it could do with a bit of adjustment in levels.  Otherwise, a good find.</td>', 'Great, a tree that is truly topless instead of one that has just been chopped off in the shot.  Don''t know that I like the center composition and it could do with a bit of adjustment in levels.  Otherwise, a good find.', '2007-11-15 05:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4248678, 611478, 6999, '<td valign="top">Interesting illustration of the effects of point of view here: this is so much like a million car photos in every on-line car sales site, except perhaps taken with a better camera, and maybe more carefully exposed. But its very difficult to make an impact with images taken from the everyday standing-up point of view - especially of everyday objects, and especially in colour: you become too much part of the world of everyone''s snapshots. <br/> <br/>Go higher, go lower, go closer, go further away, but simple framing from around  five foot up in the air is always going to be very very usual.</td>', 'Interesting illustration of the effects of point of view here: this is so much like a million car photos in every on-line car sales site, except perhaps taken with a better camera, and maybe more carefully exposed. But its very difficult to make an impact with images taken from the everyday standing-up point of view - especially of everyday objects, and especially in colour: you become too much part of the world of everyone''s snapshots.  Go higher, go lower, go closer, go further away, but simple framing from around  five foot up in the air is always going to be very very usual.', '2007-11-15 05:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4248680, 613025, 6999, '<td valign="top">Cropped too close, light too direct and uninteresting, angle of view to ordinary and obvious - all these elements will hurt your score, and make this an uninteresting image. The dead quality of light on your background also doesn''t help. The ''good'' points are that the exposure and sense of detail are fine.</td>', 'Cropped too close, light too direct and uninteresting, angle of view to ordinary and obvious - all these elements will hurt your score, and make this an uninteresting image. The dead quality of light on your background also doesn''t help. The ''good'' points are that the exposure and sense of detail are fine.', '2007-11-15 05:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4248682, 612955, 6999, '<td valign="top">Very flat exposure this: and from the look of that reflection, rather un-thought-out lighting to go with it. Sense of composition is a bit strange for a set-up image, everything being condensed across one line through the horizontal centre of frame.</td>', 'Very flat exposure this: and from the look of that reflection, rather un-thought-out lighting to go with it. Sense of composition is a bit strange for a set-up image, everything being condensed across one line through the horizontal centre of frame.', '2007-11-15 05:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4248683, 613046, 6999, '<td valign="top">Seems very under-exposed, or even un-lightened in processing. The illumination of your subject appears fine, but everything is condensed into such a restricted range of brightness that its actually hard to tell. Cropping, or perhaps lack of it, is a touch uncomfortable too.</td>', 'Seems very under-exposed, or even un-lightened in processing. The illumination of your subject appears fine, but everything is condensed into such a restricted range of brightness that its actually hard to tell. Cropping, or perhaps lack of it, is a touch uncomfortable too.', '2007-11-15 05:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4248684, 611179, 6999, '<td valign="top">Reasonably well lit, at least - something of an exception in this challenge. The plastic, of course, always makes for a moderately unappealing subject, with its liquid reflectivity. I have to say I dislike the red frame, makes me feel there''s something wrong with my eyes.</td>', 'Reasonably well lit, at least - something of an exception in this challenge. The plastic, of course, always makes for a moderately unappealing subject, with its liquid reflectivity. I have to say I dislike the red frame, makes me feel there''s something wrong with my eyes.', '2007-11-15 05:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4248686, 613020, 6999, '<td valign="top">I always think these terribly simple compositions cannot be hurt by taking things as simple as they will possibly go. The feeling that these aren''t vertical adds an unwelcome tension to the image, one that isn''t carried through in the image itself and thus feels wrong. The other element is of course the reflections, which show elements of a room and a window: clean those up, or simply use a soft-light, and you have, I think,  an interesting tonal study in a kind of black/brown world. The shape of such shiny things is actually communicated through the shape of the reflections of light - if those reflections, as here, are of a more complex world they''re likely to remove attention from what appears to be your subject: that is whay a simplification of those would work, and why every interesting shot of relective materials is almost always more softly-lit.</td>', 'I always think these terribly simple compositions cannot be hurt by taking things as simple as they will possibly go. The feeling that these aren''t vertical adds an unwelcome tension to the image, one that isn''t carried through in the image itself and thus feels wrong. The other element is of course the reflections, which show elements of a room and a window: clean those up, or simply use a soft-light, and you have, I think,  an interesting tonal study in a kind of black/brown world. The shape of such shiny things is actually communicated through the shape of the reflections of light - if those reflections, as here, are of a more complex world they''re likely to remove attention from what appears to be your subject: that is whay a simplification of those would work, and why every interesting shot of relective materials is almost always more softly-lit.', '2007-11-15 05:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4248687, 612967, 45631, '<td valign="top">Yes, it definitely fits the challenge by being topless but the harsh lighting has left a strong shadow which detracts from the image. I would have cropped the apple to be more on the right hand third line which would have eliminated the distracting top right corner.  Maybe a way to make this look a bit clever would be to have been cut it in some special way (like chefs do to decorate food platers) and a little more sharpening on the apple.</td>', 'Yes, it definitely fits the challenge by being topless but the harsh lighting has left a strong shadow which detracts from the image. I would have cropped the apple to be more on the right hand third line which would have eliminated the distracting top right corner.  Maybe a way to make this look a bit clever would be to have been cut it in some special way (like chefs do to decorate food platers) and a little more sharpening on the apple.', '2007-11-15 05:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4248688, 612446, 6999, '<td valign="top">So badly under-exposed as to be faintly absurd.</td>', 'So badly under-exposed as to be faintly absurd.', '2007-11-15 05:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4248689, 612653, 45631, '<td valign="top">I love your take on the challenge with this shot.  This is another like it (don''t you hate that) but I find this the better of the two. Complementary colors and positioned well in the frame.  This is one of my top picks.</td>', 'I love your take on the challenge with this shot.  This is another like it (don''t you hate that) but I find this the better of the two. Complementary colors and positioned well in the frame.  This is one of my top picks.', '2007-11-15 06:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4248690, 612886, 45631, '<td valign="top">Great closeup shot.  I like the composition and the mono tones of the shot.</td>', 'Great closeup shot.  I like the composition and the mono tones of the shot.', '2007-11-15 06:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4248691, 612614, 45631, '<td valign="top">This is so funny.  The Woody shots are getting quite clever lately, well done.</td>', 'This is so funny.  The Woody shots are getting quite clever lately, well done.', '2007-11-15 06:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4248692, 612342, 45631, '<td valign="top">I thought there would be a lot of bottles for this one (which there are) but this shot is very nicely done.  Complementary colors and nice and sharp.</td>', 'I thought there would be a lot of bottles for this one (which there are) but this shot is very nicely done.  Complementary colors and nice and sharp.', '2007-11-15 06:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4248693, 613079, 45631, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot (well it''s probably set up but it looks good).  Fits the challenge well.  Good composition but maybe just a bit dark though.</td>', 'Nice action shot (well it''s probably set up but it looks good).  Fits the challenge well.  Good composition but maybe just a bit dark though.', '2007-11-15 06:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4248694, 610781, 6999, '<td valign="top">I wonder if you haven''t allowed slightly <b>too</b> much space around your subject, and perhaps <b>too</b> little detail in the fallen object. I quite like the sense of composition, the way it makes the little windmill almost not the point.</td>', 'I wonder if you haven''t allowed slightly too much space around your subject, and perhaps too little detail in the fallen object. I quite like the sense of composition, the way it makes the little windmill almost not the point.', '2007-11-15 06:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4248695, 611009, 45631, '<td valign="top">Always like a shot with a different perspective.  Leaving the seal on and torn like this adds to the effect.  The only thing I could pick would be that I would like the rim and the paper all in focus.  Good job</td>', 'Always like a shot with a different perspective.  Leaving the seal on and torn like this adds to the effect.  The only thing I could pick would be that I would like the rim and the paper all in focus.  Good job', '2007-11-15 06:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
