(4249463, 612830, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective and colors. There is a blur in the bottom middle that looks like a waving branch or something. Long exposure time on this?</td>', 'I like the perspective and colors. There is a blur in the bottom middle that looks like a waving branch or something. Long exposure time on this?', '2007-11-15 13:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
