(4252153, 612829, 16197, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, I enjoy how the light itself isn''t blown out with lots of light trails.  Not sure I care for the background, maybe if it was farther way and ended up solid black.  Nice idea... might use a bit of sharpening as well.</td>', 'Interesting idea, I enjoy how the light itself isn''t blown out with lots of light trails.  Not sure I care for the background, maybe if it was farther way and ended up solid black.  Nice idea... might use a bit of sharpening as well.', '2007-11-16 15:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
