(4252173, 610087, 16197, '<td valign="top">nice idea, however the slanted angle doesn''t do anything for me.  I personally would like to see the bottle perfectly vertical.  Maybe a bit more saturation to pop the colours as well.</td>', 'nice idea, however the slanted angle doesn''t do anything for me.  I personally would like to see the bottle perfectly vertical.  Maybe a bit more saturation to pop the colours as well.', '2007-11-16 15:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
