(4253443, 612797, 67258, '<td valign="top">Looking forward to seeing who the photograpgher is and looking throughthe rest of their portfolio!  I have come back to this a number of times over the course of voting saving it for last.  The composition is superb with a really strong triangular emphasis.  The concept is novel, and works so well - I love the way the mannequin is straring at - or past - her own knee.  The vertical light on the wall is perfect in its subtelty.  The  whites on the arm are blown (at least on my monitor)which doesn''t really seem to matter - the only tiny thing I would change (which perhaps could be altered under advanced editing) would be to have a bit more definition on the hand.  That said, still a 10 from me.</td>', 'Looking forward to seeing who the photograpgher is and looking throughthe rest of their portfolio!  I have come back to this a number of times over the course of voting saving it for last.  The composition is superb with a really strong triangular emphasis.  The concept is novel, and works so well - I love the way the mannequin is straring at - or past - her own knee.  The vertical light on the wall is perfect in its subtelty.  The  whites on the arm are blown (at least on my monitor)which doesn''t really seem to matter - the only tiny thing I would change (which perhaps could be altered under advanced editing) would be to have a bit more definition on the hand.  That said, still a 10 from me.', '2007-11-17 03:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
