(4254036, 612903, 59029, '<td valign="top">beware the camera-mounted flash... they tend to give too much glare and leave photo looking flat.  Try shooting more from tabletop level without flash but indirect lighting from the sides.  Good try!</td>', 'beware the camera-mounted flash... they tend to give too much glare and leave photo looking flat.  Try shooting more from tabletop level without flash but indirect lighting from the sides.  Good try!', '2007-11-17 12:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
