(4257472, 611478, 81382, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, the background takes away from the car though and has nothing to do with the subject or challenge. If the background was nicely blurred then I think it would score higher. The high scoring images tend to be very simple. I see the car against a completely neutral/plain background doing better. The viewpoint is taken from eye level, photographs with different viewpoints have more interest. If taken from lower down (wheel height for example) then I think it would be more dramatic</td>', 'Nice idea, the background takes away from the car though and has nothing to do with the subject or challenge. If the background was nicely blurred then I think it would score higher. The high scoring images tend to be very simple. I see the car against a completely neutral/plain background doing better. The viewpoint is taken from eye level, photographs with different viewpoints have more interest. If taken from lower down (wheel height for example) then I think it would be more dramatic', '2007-11-19 08:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4257476, 610576, 81382, '<td valign="top">First thing that comes into my mind is the very strong/thick border. You also have some fairly major chromatic aberration going on; cyan at the back of the scene and magenta at the front, which is not so good and could easily have been corrected during post processing. The oranges are highly saturated and look as if they could be sharper</td>', 'First thing that comes into my mind is the very strong/thick border. You also have some fairly major chromatic aberration going on; cyan at the back of the scene and magenta at the front, which is not so good and could easily have been corrected during post processing. The oranges are highly saturated and look as if they could be sharper', '2007-11-19 08:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4257478, 610548, 81382, '<td valign="top">The duck and main concept are this image are a bit lost against the surrounding environment. The percentage area taken up by the main subject is quite small. The duck is also a bit blurred. Nice idea but a more simplified shot just against water with perhaps a nice reflection would do better</td>', 'The duck and main concept are this image are a bit lost against the surrounding environment. The percentage area taken up by the main subject is quite small. The duck is also a bit blurred. Nice idea but a more simplified shot just against water with perhaps a nice reflection would do better', '2007-11-19 08:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
