(4260386, 613079, 67152, '<td valign="top">excellent stop action shot - i just wish the lighting were a bit better - a boost on the levels would likely do the trick. A look at the levels histogram really shows that a quick adjustment would make a world of difference.  PM me if you would like to discuss more...</td>', 'excellent stop action shot - i just wish the lighting were a bit better - a boost on the levels would likely do the trick. A look at the levels histogram really shows that a quick adjustment would make a world of difference.  PM me if you would like to discuss more...', '2007-11-20 13:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
