(4260524, 611034, 811, '<td valign="top">Good composition, for the most part.  It appears that you used a flash and this really flattened things out.  Try diffusing it or bouncing it if possible.</td>', 'Good composition, for the most part.  It appears that you used a flash and this really flattened things out.  Try diffusing it or bouncing it if possible.', '2007-11-20 14:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
