(4260572, 612455, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like the "tilt" in this photograph.  If this had been a blue sky, it would have really been a nice study in color contrast.  Since it was so "plain" how does bw work?</td>', 'I really like the "tilt" in this photograph.  If this had been a blue sky, it would have really been a nice study in color contrast.  Since it was so "plain" how does bw work?', '2007-11-20 14:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
