(4260640, 613025, 50034, '<td valign="top"><b>"Aw, Nuts!  I''m ajar!"  :)</b></td>', '"Aw, Nuts!  I''m ajar!"  :)', '2007-11-20 14:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260654, 611461, 50034, '<td valign="top">Great scene, but crop is a little tight for my taste.  I think increased saturation in the Red and Green channels could make this really "pop."  (You may even want to check settings on the menu in your digital camera to see that the original color settings are as saturated as you would like them to be.)<br/> <br/>However, <b>overall great photo!  Keep on truckin'' (or jeepin''),...No Matter!  :)</b></td>', 'Great scene, but crop is a little tight for my taste.  I think increased saturation in the Red and Green channels could make this really "pop."  (You may even want to check settings on the menu in your digital camera to see that the original color settings are as saturated as you would like them to be.) However, overall great photo!  Keep on truckin'' (or jeepin''),...No Matter!  :)', '2007-11-20 15:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260669, 612446, 50034, '<td valign="top"><b>This Photo is very musical for me!</b>  Lines from songs are floating through my head as I view it..."Climb, Ev''ry mountain..." &amp; "Ain''t no mountain high enough..."  (I''m just a kid from the ''60s &amp; ''70s.)<br/> <br/>Nice photo, but I think it is a little dark and tonally nondescript.  Yet depending on "personal internal presets", someone else may see amazement in the desat environment...since this does minimize the human element.  Just a matter of taste!  :)</td>', 'This Photo is very musical for me!  Lines from songs are floating through my head as I view it..."Climb, Ev''ry mountain..." & "Ain''t no mountain high enough..."  (I''m just a kid from the ''60s & ''70s.) Nice photo, but I think it is a little dark and tonally nondescript.  Yet depending on "personal internal presets", someone else may see amazement in the desat environment...since this does minimize the human element.  Just a matter of taste!  :)', '2007-11-20 15:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260690, 612841, 50034, '<td valign="top">I understand that <b>"topless"</b> in many ways has been equated to <b>"nude" or "without bikini top".</b> <i>The terminology seems a little misleading to anyone who doesn''t speak Western-style/American-style English as a first language.</i>  I wonder if "TOP"-less would have cleared anything up at a glance.  (Truth is I don''t think any wording would be 100% understandable to everyone 100% of the time due to all the languages in the world.)<br/> <br/><b>Bottom Line:</b>  This is a great minimalist photo that is very stark, clear, and simple.  Now as to the challenge, this appears to be "Only Top" instead of "topless."  <b>I''m still willing to give you a "10" based on the strength of the image and the boldness of its simplicity!  :)</b></td>', 'I understand that "topless" in many ways has been equated to "nude" or "without bikini top". The terminology seems a little misleading to anyone who doesn''t speak Western-style/American-style English as a first language.  I wonder if "TOP"-less would have cleared anything up at a glance.  (Truth is I don''t think any wording would be 100% understandable to everyone 100% of the time due to all the languages in the world.) Bottom Line:  This is a great minimalist photo that is very stark, clear, and simple.  Now as to the challenge, this appears to be "Only Top" instead of "topless."  I''m still willing to give you a "10" based on the strength of the image and the boldness of its simplicity!  :)', '2007-11-20 15:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260693, 613044, 50034, '<td valign="top"><b>Now THAT''s what I call "double-jointed!"  :}</b></td>', 'Now THAT''s what I call "double-jointed!"  :}', '2007-11-20 15:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260696, 611459, 50034, '<td valign="top">Stark with Pathos!  Great image!  :)</td>', 'Stark with Pathos!  Great image!  :)', '2007-11-20 15:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260699, 612852, 50034, '<td valign="top">Point taken...Crystal Clear!  :}</td>', 'Point taken...Crystal Clear!  :}', '2007-11-20 15:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260705, 611530, 50034, '<td valign="top">GOOD...night, but who needs lights?  Impressive photo overall, but the white "hot spot" will keep your score "in the RED" sadly.  :(</td>', 'GOOD...night, but who needs lights?  Impressive photo overall, but the white "hot spot" will keep your score "in the RED" sadly.  :(', '2007-11-20 15:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260712, 610948, 50034, '<td valign="top">There''s that language issue again on what it means to be "topless".  Tree is denuded of leaves, but the top is still showing!  However, since I love the extreme blues (apparently from the use of a polarizer, I will still give you a "7"!  :)</td>', 'There''s that language issue again on what it means to be "topless".  Tree is denuded of leaves, but the top is still showing!  However, since I love the extreme blues (apparently from the use of a polarizer, I will still give you a "7"!  :)', '2007-11-20 15:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260717, 610548, 50034, '<td valign="top"><b>I''ll just bet there''s a TAIL behind this photo!  :)  :}  :)</b></td>', 'I''ll just bet there''s a TAIL behind this photo!  :)  :}  :)', '2007-11-20 15:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260722, 612570, 86849, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and that is taken in "profile". Good job</td>', 'I like the colors and that is taken in "profile". Good job', '2007-11-20 15:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260723, 611446, 86849, '<td valign="top">Great composition and wonderful fantasy!</td>', 'Great composition and wonderful fantasy!', '2007-11-20 15:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260725, 612597, 86849, '<td valign="top">Great shot, but does not really resound the name TOPLESS</td>', 'Great shot, but does not really resound the name TOPLESS', '2007-11-20 15:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260727, 611396, 50034, '<td valign="top">Well, your image is a little "cloudy", but apparently that was intended.  :}  The foreground horizon line is nearly bisecting the photo which IMHO weakens the image.  Crop up from the bottom about a half or third of the way in the foreground, and you have a very nice line on <b>the Rule of Thirds!</b>  Hope that helps!  :)</td>', 'Well, your image is a little "cloudy", but apparently that was intended.  :}  The foreground horizon line is nearly bisecting the photo which IMHO weakens the image.  Crop up from the bottom about a half or third of the way in the foreground, and you have a very nice line on the Rule of Thirds!  Hope that helps!  :)', '2007-11-20 15:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260729, 613044, 86849, '<td valign="top">Just perfect for this challenge! and loveley composition + backrgound</td>', 'Just perfect for this challenge! and loveley composition + backrgound', '2007-11-20 15:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
