(4262149, 612948, 27275, '<td valign="top">For those who didn''t get it :-(<br/> <br/>This was a beer glass (similar to a red wine glass)<br/> <br/>The glass was almost horizontal with some beer on it.<br/> <br/>The "nipple" was a drop of water.<br/> <br/>The background was a red card<br/> <br/>I rotate the picture ~180º <br/> <br/>The reflexions were my kitchen sink, the support I got (a simple wine bottle support) and the beer can.<br/> <br/>Maybe the picture''s name should be Beer Breast...<br/> <br/></td>', 'For those who didn''t get it :-( This was a beer glass (similar to a red wine glass) The glass was almost horizontal with some beer on it. The "nipple" was a drop of water. The background was a red card I rotate the picture ~180º  The reflexions were my kitchen sink, the support I got (a simple wine bottle support) and the beer can. Maybe the picture''s name should be Beer Breast... ', '2007-11-21 04:38:00.000000', NULL, 0),
