(4262252, 611663, 62281, '<td valign="top">Good image, but the blur looks to have been done in software as the clouds not blurred and the distance trees are still sharp, is this basic editing or an effect of using a fish eye lens ?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-11-21 06:54:24.</i></td>', 'Good image, but the blur looks to have been done in software as the clouds not blurred and the distance trees are still sharp, is this basic editing or an effect of using a fish eye lens ?', '2007-11-21 06:53:40.000000', '2007-11-21 06:54:24.000000', 0),
(4262257, 611663, 54033, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by whiteflyer:</b></div><hr/><i> Good image, but the blur looks to have been done in software as the clouds not blurred and the distance trees are still sharp, is this basic editing or an effect of using a fish eye lens ? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>This is an "abc" concept with closer and far objects in regard to motion blur. Try to blur the Sun by driving fast; I mean go really fast, if you accomplish Sun blurring, then we should consider looking into this picture in this regard.<br/> <br/><b>Not only this, but also from the shutter speed of 1/15 I bit you he was going at a speed of less than 50KM (30 miles) / hour.</b><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-11-21 07:17:19.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by whiteflyer: Good image, but the blur looks to have been done in software as the clouds not blurred and the distance trees are still sharp, is this basic editing or an effect of using a fish eye lens ?   This is an "abc" concept with closer and far objects in regard to motion blur. Try to blur the Sun by driving fast; I mean go really fast, if you accomplish Sun blurring, then we should consider looking into this picture in this regard. Not only this, but also from the shutter speed of 1/15 I bit you he was going at a speed of less than 50KM (30 miles) / hour.', '2007-11-21 07:06:22.000000', '2007-11-21 07:17:19.000000', 0),
(4262314, 612886, 66348, '<td valign="top">Very impressive Irene, you really did take something and turn it into a work of art. Lighting is incredible, and I love your composition. Congrats on top 5!</td>', 'Very impressive Irene, you really did take something and turn it into a work of art. Lighting is incredible, and I love your composition. Congrats on top 5!', '2007-11-21 07:46:32.000000', NULL, 0),
