(4262544, 610996, 31403, '<td valign="top">oh, what you do with basic is a beautiful thing to behold.  I continue to marvel at how you see the world through your camera.<br/> <br/>I frequently drop by your Flickr site, but my comment would be drown out in the general cry of your fans there. <br/> <br/>So you get a quiet one here.  You''re great at this photography and processing thing.  <br/> <br/>Your work continues to move me.<br/> <br/>I''m a fan.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-11-21 10:18:20.</i></td>', 'oh, what you do with basic is a beautiful thing to behold.  I continue to marvel at how you see the world through your camera. I frequently drop by your Flickr site, but my comment would be drown out in the general cry of your fans there.  So you get a quiet one here.  You''re great at this photography and processing thing.   Your work continues to move me. I''m a fan.', '2007-11-21 10:17:45.000000', '2007-11-21 10:18:20.000000', 0),
