(4262826, 613088, 77250, '<td valign="top">I think that this was the best shot in the challenge.  For all the people that said it doesn''t meet the challenge requirements: the subject of the photo is "topless".  Its a building that holds a bunch of topless things.  I think it works fine but everybody that didn''t is just taking things too literal and wants to see a snapshot with the top of something cut off.  I love the cool tones too.</td>', 'I think that this was the best shot in the challenge.  For all the people that said it doesn''t meet the challenge requirements: the subject of the photo is "topless".  Its a building that holds a bunch of topless things.  I think it works fine but everybody that didn''t is just taking things too literal and wants to see a snapshot with the top of something cut off.  I love the cool tones too.', '2007-11-21 12:26:18.000000', NULL, 0),
