(4283252, 613065, 66384, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the well deserved OOBIE. It doesn''t really seem so out of the box to me, it''s a beautiful work of art that to my mind fits the challenge very well. I gave it a 9. Wonderful composition, beautiful tone, and I love the textures and light.</td>', 'Congratulations on the well deserved OOBIE. It doesn''t really seem so out of the box to me, it''s a beautiful work of art that to my mind fits the challenge very well. I gave it a 9. Wonderful composition, beautiful tone, and I love the textures and light.', '2007-12-02 17:21:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4288184, 613004, 63269, '<td valign="top">hmm... this is a very clever idea, and well executed! I will admit however that my first impression was not so good, until I read the details. The top almost looks like it wasn''t exposed properly, instead of looking like a neat time-exposure trick. Perhaps the viewer would "get it" if there was a little motion streak trailing after the apple top. Just a thought. :) I really like the nice clean light and the rich colors though, and it certainly is a neat idea!</td>', 'hmm... this is a very clever idea, and well executed! I will admit however that my first impression was not so good, until I read the details. The top almost looks like it wasn''t exposed properly, instead of looking like a neat time-exposure trick. Perhaps the viewer would "get it" if there was a little motion streak trailing after the apple top. Just a thought. :) I really like the nice clean light and the rich colors though, and it certainly is a neat idea!', '2007-12-04 12:00:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4301066, 612340, 10909, '<td valign="top">Hmm, is congratulation really more "helpful" comment than critics?<br/>Well, seems this world is getting turned upside down...<br/> <br/>Mick - we all here just express our opinions. I''ve said "...to ME it looks...".<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-12-08 07:22:57.</i></td>', 'Hmm, is congratulation really more "helpful" comment than critics?Well, seems this world is getting turned upside down... Mick - we all here just express our opinions. I''ve said "...to ME it looks...".', '2007-12-08 07:17:08.000000', '2007-12-08 07:22:57.000000', 0),
(4301271, 612340, 78146, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Nafigator:</b></div><hr/><i> Hmm, is congratulation really more "helpful" comment than critics?<br/>Well, seems this world is getting turned upside down...<br/> <br/>Mick - we all here just express our opinions. I''ve said "...to ME it looks...". </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>... while i find constructive criticism quite helpful, i did not particularly find *your* comment helpful, since it seemed to me to be negativity without any pointers on where to go.  of all the comments i''ve received, i''ve only not checked two comments as helpful... yours being one.  i think that speaks for itself.  if i''m not allowed to choose which comments i feel are helpful, what''s the button for?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-12-09 09:43:41.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Nafigator: Hmm, is congratulation really more "helpful" comment than critics?Well, seems this world is getting turned upside down... Mick - we all here just express our opinions. I''ve said "...to ME it looks...".   ... while i find constructive criticism quite helpful, i did not particularly find *your* comment helpful, since it seemed to me to be negativity without any pointers on where to go.  of all the comments i''ve received, i''ve only not checked two comments as helpful... yours being one.  i think that speaks for itself.  if i''m not allowed to choose which comments i feel are helpful, what''s the button for?', '2007-12-08 09:35:22.000000', '2007-12-09 09:43:41.000000', 0),
(4301851, 612340, 10909, '<td valign="top">It seemed to me that telling somebody about "not fresh" idea was enough to make him think: well... maybe really? - it''s enough to look around here - and next time to make something never done before what would catch eye right away.<br/>If under useful criticism you mean technical questions - for me, good idea is #1. Sorry, bud...</td>', 'It seemed to me that telling somebody about "not fresh" idea was enough to make him think: well... maybe really? - it''s enough to look around here - and next time to make something never done before what would catch eye right away.If under useful criticism you mean technical questions - for me, good idea is #1. Sorry, bud...', '2007-12-08 16:17:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4302273, 612340, 78146, '<td valign="top">i''ll keep that in mind and try to think more outside the box in future challenges.  <br/> <br/>and by the way, i''m a her, not a him.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-12-11 11:20:02.</i></td>', 'i''ll keep that in mind and try to think more outside the box in future challenges.   and by the way, i''m a her, not a him.', '2007-12-08 20:53:13.000000', '2007-12-11 11:20:02.000000', 0),
