(4421217, 612955, 49804, '<td valign="top">This shot has a lot of potential but it needs a few things. Adding contrast with your lighting would help this shot a lot. Also another thing would be making the background either a solid color, or a gradient of sorts. Those two things alone would add a lot. Also maybe try arranging them where they lead to the tops in the background to make that part stand out more, really nice idea.</td>', 'This shot has a lot of potential but it needs a few things. Adding contrast with your lighting would help this shot a lot. Also another thing would be making the background either a solid color, or a gradient of sorts. Those two things alone would add a lot. Also maybe try arranging them where they lead to the tops in the background to make that part stand out more, really nice idea.', '2008-01-24 11:53:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4421572, 612955, 40718, '<td valign="top">Technicals:  As I''m sure you can guess, this is pretty underexposed.  You might have been able to save it in Photoshop or another program, but sometimes raising the exposure of an underexposed shot will bring out a bunch of noise.  The composition is not bad at all.  It is not centered, which is good, and I like the blurred "top" in the background.<br/> <br/>The feel: I think it''s a creative idea.  The composition, like I mentioned, is what makes the photo.  I will admit though, that shots of little trinkets and kitsch like this rarely do well on DPC.</td>', 'Technicals:  As I''m sure you can guess, this is pretty underexposed.  You might have been able to save it in Photoshop or another program, but sometimes raising the exposure of an underexposed shot will bring out a bunch of noise.  The composition is not bad at all.  It is not centered, which is good, and I like the blurred "top" in the background. The feel: I think it''s a creative idea.  The composition, like I mentioned, is what makes the photo.  I will admit though, that shots of little trinkets and kitsch like this rarely do well on DPC.', '2008-01-24 13:31:50.000000', NULL, 0),
